### Solution:
```java
public String reverseWords(String message) {
    String[] words = message.split(" "); // Split the message into words using space as delimiter
    StringBuilder reversedMessage = new StringBuilder();

    for (String word : words) {
        StringBuilder reversedWord = new StringBuilder(word).reverse(); // Reverse each word
