```
<service_name>_<metric_name>{{<label_name>="<label_value>", ...}} <value>
```
where `<service_name>` is the name of the service, `<metric_name>` is the name of the metric, `<label_name>` and `<label_value>` represent the label names and values, and `<value>` is the metric value.

