- Each rule will be on a new line.
- Selectors and properties will be separated by a colon.
- Multiple properties will be separated by semicolons.
- Selectors and properties will not contain any whitespace.

For example, given the following `cssString`:
```
.container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
}
