You are tasked with implementing a simple calculator using the provided Rust code snippet as a starting point. The calculator supports basic arithmetic operations such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. The calculator operates on values and expressions, where an expression can be a single value or a combination of values and sub-expressions.

